llection-card__content notion-collection-card__property-list\"><div class=\"notion-property notion-property__title notion-collection-card__property title notion-semantic-string\"></div></div></div><div id=\"block-3c20d1493317800d89ffd1dc5e4c31e7\" class=\"notion-collection-card gallery\"><a id=\"block-3c20d1493317800d89ffd1dc5e4c31e7\" href=\"/3c20d1493317800d89ffd1dc5e4c31e7\" class=\"notion-link notion-collection-card__anchor\" data-link-uri=\"/3c20d1493317800d89ffd1dc5e4c31e7\"></a><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/3b044198-336f-491a-bfc9-44867ad6a83e/photo-5007479/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/3b044198-336f-491a-bfc9-44867ad6a83e/photo-5007479/public\"><img alt=\"item\" class=\"notion-collection-card__cover medium\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/3b044198-336f-491a-bfc9-44867ad6a83e/photo-5007479/public\"></span><div class=\"notion-collection-card__content notion-collection-card__property-list\"><div class=\"notion-property notion-property__title notion-collection-card__property title notion-semantic-string\"></div></div></div><div id=\"block-3c20d149331780ad946ffee918fd14f6\" class=\"notion-collection-card gallery\"><a id=\"block-3c20d149331780ad946ffee918fd14f6\" href=\"/3c20d149331780ad946ffee918fd14f6\" class=\"notion-link notion-collection-card__anchor\" data-link-uri=\"/3c20d149331780ad946ffee918fd14f6\"></a><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/42da500e-190f-4d37-ab8e-a72a6e57b176/photo-5013024/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/42da500e-190f-4d37-ab8e-a72a6e57b176/photo-5013024/public\"><img alt=\"item\" class=\"notion-collection-card__cover medium\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/42da500e-190f-4d37-ab8e-a72a6e57b176/photo-5013024/public\"></span><div class=\"notion-collection-card__content notion-collection-card__property-list\"><div class=\"notion-property notion-property__title notion-collection-card__property title notion-semantic-string\"></div></div></div><div id=\"block-3c20d149331780b39f2acde0ca98a398\" class=\"notion-collection-card gallery\"><a id=\"block-3c20d149331780b39f2acde0ca98a398\" href=\"/3c20d149331780b39f2acde0ca98a398\" class=\"notion-link notion-collection-card__anchor\" data-link-uri=\"/3c20d149331780b39f2acde0ca98a398\"></a><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/53940c41-dfbb-4af9-9679-e0707dd3ae7d/photo-5013018/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/53940c41-dfbb-4af9-9679-e0707dd3ae7d/photo-5013018/public\"><img alt=\"item\" class=\"notion-collection-card__cover medium\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/53940c41-dfbb-4af9-9679-e0707dd3ae7d/photo-5013018/public\"></span><div class=\"notion-collection-card__content notion-collection-card__property-list\"><div class=\"notion-property notion-property__title notion-collection-card__property title notion-semantic-string\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><h1 id=\"block-9caf884cf9a440e09fc2884f9fdd6a69\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Pour 8 personnes</h1><p id=\"block-8e056aaeab364344935bce8ed8a39e7e\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">La Chevêche se situe dans une grande bâtisse composée de 2 hébergements indépendants, partageant le même couloir d'entrée. Le reste du bâtiment accueille une habitante, nos salles  disponibles à la location et la cuisine professionnelle.</p><p id=\"block-506da34f4c2a408fb774fb21c01662be\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Cet hébergement pour 8 personnes se situe au rez-de-chaussée.</p><h2 id=\"block-1630d149331780f7bc7be12a121088e8\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Le séjour</h2><p id=\"block-1630d149331780948c75ef571795da46\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">→ Une table pour 8 personnes</p><p id=\"block-1630d1493317801bab42e5fc71fbb632\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">→ Un petit salon</p><p id=\"block-1630d1493317804da0f2c926d23a788f\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">→ Une cassette à bois 🪵&nbsp;🔥</p><h2 id=\"block-1630d149331780139fb7d556a9f10447\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">La cuisine équipée</h2><p id=\"block-1630d14933178031b089e72df18c48a7\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">→ Taques au gaz, four et frigo (il n’y a pas de lave-vaisselle)</p><p id=\"block-1630d1493317808cae21fc69e8bc29fc\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">→ Percolateur et bouilloire</p><p id=\"block-1630d149331780a186e1f46fd351fd56\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">→ Grille-pain</p><h2 id=\"block-1630d14933178063a2c9df970253a778\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">La chambre “Balsamine”</h2><p id=\"block-1630d14933178065a89cf03a44eb87c1\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">→ 2 lits simples pouvant être réunis en un lit double + 1 lit superposé</p><p id=\"block-1630d149331780768366c06647a78cf2\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">→ Une salle de douche avec douche, WC et évier</p><h2 id=\"block-1630d1493317802194e5c21868473c00\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">La chambre “Romarin”</h2><p id=\"block-79090a1472fa4f85aee57c9b923fc2fd\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">→ 2 lits simples pouvant être réunis en un lit double + 1 lit superposé</p><p id=\"block-1630d1493317807f8621e7536e2a5730\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">→ Une salle de douche avec douche, WC et évier</p><div id=\"block-78c82d92ee2c44a7b6c7b5aba7272c89\" class=\"notion-column-list\"><div id=\"block-796c4c7dadcc4c9c9f1427237a64316c\" class=\"notion-column\" data-width=\"50%\"><h2 id=\"block-19c48e2b25c54df48930ccb22b9144e8\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Salles de douche 🚿</h2><p id=\"block-3dd8d7863c2d48c28ffcc44cf52a4c22\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">CHAQUE CHAMBRE dispose d'une salle de douche avec douche, lavabo et WC.</p><h2 id=\"block-16f0d149331780c385eedb7cc712a33e\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Draps de lit</h2><p id=\"block-16f0d1493317801ea576c447df4badb1\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Nous vous invitons à venir avec vos propres draps. Si nécessaire, nous fournissons des draps pour 10€/lit.</p><h2 id=\"block-1320d149331780afa005fb60dafe938a\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Arrivée et départ</h2><ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\"><li id=\"block-1320d149331780a68445fb39fd79b241\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">Arrivée après 16h</li><li id=\"block-1320d149331780a7b0e3d59400c12b3b\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">Départ</li><ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\"><li id=\"block-10cb939c5ba44aa9a21b07d4c022b3a0\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">En semaine : 12h</li><li id=\"block-30606c6970a54b50aac9994f7e2e884c\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">Le dimanche : 20h</li></ul></ul></div><div id=\"block-b1d72a4965a94b3daf5505129c16c8b9\" class=\"notion-column\" data-width=\"50%\"><h2 id=\"block-ae4b7c8767964a979e9fc728df36a26d\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Accès internet 🛜</h2><p id=\"block-22bc987b5a794ad2808e62e370a5f98a\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Une connexion filaire (par câble réseau) est disponible dans la cuisine et via point d’accès WiFi. Connexion internet de 70 Mbps.</p><h2 id=\"block-28a0d14933178049a05aff0bc7818a20\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Carte de balades 🥾</h2><p id=\"block-28a0d1493317800ba8a9f35d85cd20bb\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Notre carte de balades, disponible dans la Chevêche, permet de partir majoritairement des 4 Sources et de découvrir les forêts et paysages de la vallée du Bocq.</p><h2 id=\"block-16f0d1493317808589f6f82afa764650\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Coworking 🖥️</h2><p id=\"block-16f0d149331780a3b329e84fc788ab6a\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Nous pouvons mettre à votre disposition un espace lumineux avec 3 bureaux. N’hésitez pas à nous signaler votre intérêt pour cet espace.</p><ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\"><li id=\"block-16f0d149331780c8acc8dfe52ff74c2e\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">WiFi et câbles ethernet</li><li id=\"block-16f0d149331780ff8b7ec64cdfb60880\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">2 écrans HDMI</li><li id=\"block-16f0d14933178028bd14fa43f18d5a17\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">3 chaises ergonomiques</li><li id=\"block-16f0d14933178053bb45eb80b0954b4f\" class=\"notion-list-item notion-semantic-string\">Flipchart</li></ul></div></div><div id=\"block-1390d149331780f6be89eab4ac512282\" class=\"notion-button\"><a class=\"notion-link notion-button__content\" href=\"/sejours/tarifs\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">Tarifs des hébergements et salles</span></a></div><div id=\"block-1390d149331780e19895ea5ca9416567\" class=\"notion-button\"><a class=\"notion-link notion-button__content\" href=\"/sejours/disponibilites\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">Disponibilités</span></a></div><div id=\"block-1390d1493317807c9d94efacc3d92a66\" class=\"notion-button\"><a class=\"notion-link notion-button__content\" href=\"/sejours/sejours\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\">Faire une demande de séjour</span></a></div>",
